# Two input arms (sites 1 to 5 and 6 to 10) meet at site 11; the output arm runs from 11 to 16. Two pulses arriving together and in phase add their fields at the junction and fire it.
# Reference: the same network integrated independently (complex arithmetic, LSODA).
title Weak junction, both inputs together: AND
sites 16
path 1 5 kappa=0.06
path 6 10 kappa=0.06
path 11 16 kappa=0.06
link 5 11 kappa=0.03
link 10 11 kappa=0.03
kick 1 amplitude=2
kick 6 amplitude=2
run 1200
